<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-ρρευσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flowing from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν τὰς ἀ.</span> to be <i>the
				source of streams,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.28.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀέρος οὐ δεχομένου τὰς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.933c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Astrol., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρροια</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				146.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μανίας καὶ λύττης ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Junc.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.50.27
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρρυσις</span> (q.v.) shd.
			perh. be read in these passages.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>folly,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφροσύνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>De.</u>
				22.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				25.25
			</span></i>.</div>
